ve heard something...)","nextNodeIds":[760550302]},{"nodeId":760550302,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":2864835746,"text":"Strange... I think I hear something.","nextNodeIds":[760550303]},{"nodeId":760550303,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7145,"speakerName":"Pavlov","textMapHash":3692515194,"text":"(Ah, guests! Come, come! Spin the wheel, then stop the wheel, and then there'll be good food!)","nextNodeIds":[760550304]},{"nodeId":760550304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7145,"speakerName":"Pavlov","textMapHash":3303902098,"text":"(Huh? Why aren't you spinning the wheel? Go on, spin it. Good food awaits!)","nextNodeIds":[760550305]},{"nodeId":760550305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":706529690,"text":"A little dog...? Are you asking me to spin your wheel for you?","nextNodeIds":[760550306]},{"nodeId":760550306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7145,"speakerName":"Pavlov","textMapHash":680799418,"text":"(Ho there, guests! You can speak to me! Well, please spin the wheel, then, or I shan't have anything delicious to eat!)","nextNodeIds":[760550307]},{"nodeId":760550307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":2594140418,"text":"Are you hungry? I just bought some snacks. Here, have a bit.","nextNodeIds":[760550308]},{"nodeId":760550308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7145,"speakerName":"Pavlov","textMapHash":227837466,"text":"(Hmm? You're not spinning the wheel, but you want to give me food... Hmm, sure. I'll grab some first. Why not?)","nextNodeIds":[760550309]},{"nodeId":760550309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7145,"speakerName":"Pavlov","textMapHash":975982466,"text":"(Thank you, guest. Pavlov's the name, and thanks for the food! It was dee-licious! Still, you didn't spin the wheel.)","nextNodeIds":[760550310]},{"nodeId":760550310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":3024978706,"text":"These snacks are rather good. But... this wheel you mentioned... what exactly does it do?","nextNodeIds":[760550311]},{"nodeId":760550311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7145,"speakerName":"Pavlov","textMapHash":3584969722,"text":"(If the wheel is spun, then stopped, good food will drop down. That's how it always is.)","nextNodeIds":[760550312]},{"nodeId":760550312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7145,"speakerName":"Pavlov","textMapHash":219215082,"text":"(Won't you spin the wheel, dear guest? Everyone feels happy after spinning it.)","nextNodeIds":[760550313]},{"nodeId":760550313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":2330870634,"text":"If I spin the wheel... will you be happy?","nextNodeIds":[760550314]},{"nodeId":760550314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7145,"speakerName":"Pavlov","textMapHash":2402435746,"text":"(Of course, of course! People play with me, the wheel plays with me, and there's good food... the food is the best part!)","nextNodeIds":[760550315]},{"nodeId":760550315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":1967670170,"text":"I see... Yes, good food is important. Here, take the rest of these as well.","nextNodeIds":[760550316]},{"nodeId":760550316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":1666215650,"text":"I need to go buy more. See you, Pavlov.","nextNodeIds":[760550317]},{"nodeId":760550317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7145,"speakerName":"Pavlov","textMapHash":6514842,"text":"(Mmm... yummy, yummy! Goodbye, guest! Come again!)","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7605501,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7605503,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execAction